        "original_id": "7ab515ca-724e-5d9f-8eb7-47c28e4bebc7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Pirate Adventure Park, Ireland, west of Ireland\n- Products: Pirates Plunge\n- People: Grace O'Malley, Eoghan Dubhdara Ó Máille\n- Organizations: Ó Máille dynasty\n- Roles: lord\n\nFacts:\n- Grace O'Malley lived circa 1530 to circa 1603.\n- Grace O'Malley was also known as Gráinne O'Malley and by the Irish name Gráinne Ní Mháille.\n- Grace O'Malley was lord of the Ó Máille dynasty in the west of Ireland.\n- Grace O'Malley followed her father Eoghan Dubhdara Ó Máille as lord of the Ó Máille dynasty.\n- Pirate Adventure Park is home to Pirates Plunge.\n- Pirates Plunge is the first flume ride in Ireland.",
